Package: hawkesNet
Title: Likelihood and Simulation for Self-Exciting Network Updates
Version: 0.3.0
Author: Duncan A. Clark
Maintainer: Duncan A. Clark <dac6@williams.edu>
Authors@R: 
    person("Duncan", "Clark", , "dac6@williams.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates and fits marked point processes whose events are
    complete network updates. Provides normalized Poisson-proposal update
    laws, Hawkes timing models, and likelihood and simulation diagnostics.
    Includes directed package-dependency models with births, edge additions
    and deletions, paired migrations, shared-person covariates, and finite
    mixtures, alongside reference models for undirected birth and turnover.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
